# guest_wing — a guest bedroom with its own bath, composed from a NESTED part
# (Phase 20). The `use` resolves relative to THIS part's folder and stamps
# flex_bath one level deeper; at the host the bath's id is <alias>.gb.bath. A clean
# 12 ft-wide strip (bath below, bed above) so a host room on its east wall reaches
# both, and the bed's west wall carries its egress window (place that wall exterior).
use "flex_bath.barn" as gb at 0,0 with width=12, depth=7
room bed: bedroom at 0,7 size 12 x 13
door bed - gb.bath width 2.5 into gb.bath hinge near
window bed west casement width 4 offset 4 sill 2
alarm smoke in bed
